name: the Family panel stays up when one of the client's own tabs is clicked
file: addons/Family_UI/Auctions.lua
--- old
		Family:TryCall(_G.hooksecurefunc, "AuctionFrameTab_OnClick", function()
			if panel then panel:Hide() end
		end)
--- new
